window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>How much trouble could one woman be?</b></p> <p><b>Graham Everett is about to find out.</b></p> <p>His best friend's gorgeous new employee may be the one thing between Graham and his rightful place at the top of Manhattan's elite, but he isn't worried. He's pretty sure he can bring any woman to her knees. Even her.</p> <p><b>Juliet Rivera is not impressed.</b></p> <p>With the state of men, generally. But, more specifically, Graham Everett and his Playboy nonsense. It's all under control, though. She's not worried. She can handle anything. Even him.</p> <p>The man clearly has no idea who he's dealing with.</p>"; 
